{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of Canvas, where you become an artist competing in a prestigious art festival. This digital adaptation of the beloved board game brings the joy of painting to your fingertips.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/extras/three_artworks.png?t=1750938223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Canvas, you combine transparent Art Cards to form beautiful paintings, with each card adding new elements and icons that influence your final score. You\u2019ll need to make strategic choices about which cards to use and how to layer them to maximize your points, covering or revealing icons to meet scoring conditions and earn ribbons. Each combination of cards results in a unique illustration and title for your painting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/extras/layering.png?t=1750938223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features stunning artwork on each card, designed to inspire your creativity. While the rules are simple and make Canvas accessible to all players, the strategic depth ensures a challenging experience for seasoned gamers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in alpha stage and supports:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Local multiplayer with friends on the same device (or via Steam Remote Play) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Solo game vs AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LANGUAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a9 2025 Mipmap, under license from Road To Infamy Games (R2i Games)</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3209240?t=1750938223","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750938223","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/5447dc25b65b2e01c660ec252375dd42d9e217c3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750938223","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/5447dc25b65b2e01c660ec252375dd42d9e217c3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750938223","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into the world of Canvas, where you become an artist competing in a prestigious art festival. This digital adaptation of the beloved board game brings the joy of painting to your fingertips.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/extras/three_artworks.png?t=1750938223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Canvas, you combine transparent Art Cards to form beautiful paintings, with each card adding new elements and icons that influence your final score. You\u2019ll need to make strategic choices about which cards to use and how to layer them to maximize your points, covering or revealing icons to meet scoring conditions and earn ribbons. Each combination of cards results in a unique illustration and title for your painting. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/extras/layering.png?t=1750938223\" /></div></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game features stunning artwork on each card, designed to inspire your creativity. While the rules are simple and make Canvas accessible to all players, the strategic depth ensures a challenging experience for seasoned gamers. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game is currently in alpha stage and supports:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Local multiplayer with friends on the same device (or via Steam Remote Play) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u2022 Solo game vs AI</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">LANGUAGE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">English</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a9 2025 Mipmap, under license from Road To Infamy Games (R2i Games)</p>","developers":["Mipmap Digital"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3209240/header.jpg?t=1750938223","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Ubuntu 20.04, Ubuntu 18.04, and CentOS 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 1.6 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> OpenGL 3.2+, Vulkan capable.</li></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Mac OS X 10.14+<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 1.6 GHz or better<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 600 MB available space</li></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257139856,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139856/movie480.mp4?t=1747252434","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257139856/movie_max.mp4?t=1747252434"},"name":"Canvas Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/